Package: com.mbucc9000.cameralevel
Name: CameraLevel
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Adds the level from newer iPhones to the Camera grid. A line in the middle of the preview tilts as you tilt the phone and turns yellow when the shot is perfectly level. Shows whenever Grid is on.
Author: mbucc9000
Maintainer: mbucc9000
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
